ar (posponer is equally natural). Cancelar renders call off, aguantar renders put up with, and guardar renders put away. Spanish has no verb-plus-particle category; one verb carries the whole phrasal sense."}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Estar en la gloria"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Pull someone’s leg","To tease someone","To joke with someone"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0006-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Tomarle el pelo a alguien"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-1111-4005-0006-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Very rarely","Hardly ever"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Salut"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["S'il te plaît"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Thanks"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-2222-1001-0001-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","