nslate: “Although your proposal appears feasible in principle, we should first clarify what additional costs will arise and who will take responsibility for funding them.” Start with “Obwohl Ihr” and end with “Finanzierung übernimmt.”.","correct_answer":"Obwohl Ihr Vorschlag grundsätzlich umsetzbar erscheint, sollten wir zunächst klären, welche zusätzlichen Kosten entstehen und wer die Verantwortung für ihre Finanzierung übernimmt.","metadata":{"tiles":["Obwohl","Ihr","Vorschlag","grundsätzlich","umsetzbar","erscheint,","sollten","wir","zunächst","klären,","welche","zusätzlichen","Kosten","entstehen","und","wer","die","Verantwortung","für","ihre","Finanzierung","übernimmt."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0001-b20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Protagonistin","Hauptfigur"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0001-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0001-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Plot twist","correct_answer":"Wendepunkt","metadata":{"tiles":["Wendepunkt"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “In this painting, the shift from dark to light colors marks a turning point in the depicted story without explicitly explaining it.” Start with “In diesem” and end with “zu erklären.”.","correct_answer":"In diesem Gemälde markiert der Wechsel von dunklen zu hellen Farben einen Wendepunkt in der dargestellten Geschichte, ohne ihn ausdrücklich zu erklären.","metadata":{"tiles":["In","diesem","Gemälde","markiert","der","Wechsel","von","dunklen","zu","hellen","Farben","einen","Wendepunkt","in","der","dargestellten","Geschichte,","ohne","ihn","ausdrücklich","zu","erklären."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0002-b2000