sson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Inspiration","correct_answer":"Inspiration","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["Inspiration"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “The composer found her inspiration in traditional melodies, which she placed in a new context through surprising harmonies and changing rhythms.” Start with “Die Komponistin” and end with “Zusammenhang stellte.”.","correct_answer":"Die Komponistin fand ihre Inspiration in traditionellen Melodien, die sie durch überraschende Harmonien und wechselnde Rhythmen in einen neuen Zusammenhang stellte.","accepted_answers":["Die Komponistin fand ihre Inspiration in traditionellen Melodien, die sie durch wechselnde Rhythmen und überraschende Harmonien in einen neuen Zusammenhang stellte."],"metadata":{"tiles":["Die","Komponistin","fand","ihre","Inspiration","in","traditionellen","Melodien,","die","sie","durch","überraschende","Harmonien","und","wechselnde","Rhythmen","in","einen","neuen","Zusammenhang","stellte."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0004-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"Roman\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Novel","options":["Novel","Painting","Plot twist","Genre"],"distractors":[]},"after":{"prompt":"Which change does „Das Tempo wird schneller“ describe in a music review?","correct_answer":"The music gets faster.","options":["The music gets quieter.","The music gets slower.","The music gets faster.","The music starts again."],"distractors":["The music gets quieter.","The music gets slower.","The music starts again."]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-3333-4004-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Symbolismus"]}},{"table"