but"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4002-0006-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4002-0006-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: To persuade","correct_answer":"Persuadir","metadata":{"tiles":["Persuadir"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “To persuade a distrustful audience, we should explain why the proposal deserves to be taken seriously.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “Para persuadir” and end with “a sério.”.","correct_answer":"Para persuadir um público desconfiado, devemos explicar por que a proposta merece ser levada a sério.","metadata":{"tiles":["Para","persuadir","um","público","desconfiado,","devemos","explicar","por","que","a","proposta","merece","ser","levada","a","sério."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0001-b20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Agenda","Ordem do dia"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0001-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0001-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Minutes","correct_answer":"Ata","metadata":{"tiles":["Ata"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “I am forwarding the meeting minutes so that everyone can check the decisions before approving the document.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “Encaminho a” and end with “de aprová-la.”.","correct_answer":"Encaminho a ata da reunião para que todos possam conferir as decisões antes de aprová-la.","metadata":{"tiles":["Encaminho","a","ata","da","reunião","para","que","todos","possam","conferir","as","decisões","antes","de","aprová-la."],"d