ompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “We can review the terms of the agreement, provided that the efficiency of the service is preserved.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “Podemos rever” and end with “seja preservada.”.","correct_answer":"Podemos rever as condições do acordo, desde que a eficiência do serviço seja preservada.","metadata":{"tiles":["Podemos","rever","as","condições","do","acordo,","desde","que","a","eficiência","do","serviço","seja","preservada."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0004-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Estimate","Quotation"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0004-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0004-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Deadline","correct_answer":"Prazo","metadata":{"tiles":["Prazo"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “The report recommends extending the deadline so that those responsible can analyze the results carefully.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “O relatório” and end with “com cuidado.”.","correct_answer":"O relatório recomenda ampliar o prazo para que os responsáveis possam analisar os resultados com cuidado.","metadata":{"tiles":["O","relatório","recomenda","ampliar","o","prazo","para","que","os","responsáveis","possam","analisar","os","resultados","com","cuidado."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Interested party"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4003-0005-e0