ded that the initial investment is approved.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “A proposta” and end with “seja aprovado.”.","correct_answer":"A proposta prevê uma redução gradual dos custos, contanto que o investimento inicial seja aprovado.","accepted_answers":["A proposta prevê uma gradual redução dos custos, contanto que o investimento inicial seja aprovado."],"metadata":{"tiles":["A","proposta","prevê","uma","redução","gradual","dos","custos,","contanto","que","o","investimento","inicial","seja","aprovado."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Poesia"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-b20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Personagem principal"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-5555-4004-0001-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Plot twist","correct_answer":"Reviravolta","metadata":{"tiles":["Reviravolta"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word to translate: “The film’s final plot twist changes the meaning of the images that seemed merely decorative at the beginning.” Use ordinary subject-before-verb order in declarative clauses when a noun or pronoun subject is supplied. Start with “A reviravolta” and end with “no início.”.","correct_answer":"A reviravolta final do filme altera o significado das imagens que pareciam apenas decorativas no início.","metadata":{"tiles":["A","reviravolta","final","do","filme","altera","o","significado","das","imagens","que","pareciam","apenas","decorativas","no","início."],"distractors":[]}}},{"tabl