6-2006-0006-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: To plan","correct_answer":"計画する","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["計画する"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “I will plan next month's trip together with my friends.” Start with “来月の” and end with “計画する予定です。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"来月の旅行を友達と一緒に計画する予定です。","accepted_answers":["来月の旅行を一緒に友達と計画する予定です。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["来月の","旅行を","友達と","一緒に","計画する予定です。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0001-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: More expensive","correct_answer":"もっと高い","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["もっと高い"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “This bag costs more than that bag.” Start with “この” and end with “もっと高いです。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"このかばんはあのかばんより値段がもっと高いです。","accepted_answers":["このかばんは値段があのかばんよりもっと高いです。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["この","かばんは","あのかばんより","値段が","もっと高いです。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0002-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["もっと高価"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0002-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Taller","correct_answer":"もっと背が高い","metadata":{"tiles":["もっと背が高い"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “My older brother is taller than my father.” Start with “私の兄は” and end with “背が高いです。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"私の兄は父と比べると、もっと背が高いです。","metadata":{"tiles":["私の兄は","父と","比べると、","もっと","背が高いです。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"もっと良い\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Better","options":["Cheaper","Worse","The best","Better"],"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"本Aは100円、本Bは200円、本Cは300円です。この三冊の中で、どの本が一番高いですか。","correct_answer":"Book C","options":["Book A","Book C","Book B","All three cost the same"],"explanation":"一番高い asks for the most expensive. Of these three books, book C has the highest stated price: 300 yen.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"comparison set + 一番 + adjective"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Japanese: Worse","correct_answer":"もっと悪い","accepted_answers":[],"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Context: You are comparing three books. Translate to Japanese using この本 and 一番, ending with polite です: This book is the cheapest.","correct_answer":"この本が一番安いです。","accepted_answers":["この本は一番安いです。","この本がいちばん安いです。","この本はいちばん安いです。","一番安いのはこの本です。","いちばん安いのはこの本です。","一番安い本はこの本です。","いちばん安い本はこの本です。","この三冊の中でこの本が一番安いです。","この三冊の中で、この本が一番安いです。","この本がこの三冊の中で一番安いです。","この三冊の中でこの本がいちばん安いです。","この三冊の中で、この本がいちばん安いです。","この本がこの三冊の中でいちばん安いです。","この三冊の中でこの本は一番安いです。","この三冊の中で、この本は一番安いです。","この本はこの三冊の中で一番安いです。","この三冊の中でこの本はいちばん安いです。","この三冊の中で、この本はいちばん安いです。","この本はこの三冊の中でいちばん安いです。"],"explanation":"一番安い means “the cheapest” in this group. Both この本が and この本は can identify this book in the stated context. The instruction supplies a polite sentence frame; it does not make explicit topics mandatory in all Japanese sentences.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"一番 + adjective in a comparison group"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: もっと安い","correct_answer":"Cheaper","accepted_answers":[],"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English: このホテルはこの町で一番安いです。","correct_answer":"This hotel is the cheapest in this town.","accepted_answers":["This is the cheapest hotel in this town.","This hotel is the least expensive in this town.","This is the least expensive hotel in this town.","This hotel's the cheapest in this town.","This is this town's cheapest hotel.","This hotel is the cheapest in town.","This is the cheapest hotel in town.","This hotel is the least expensive in town.","This is the least expensive hotel in town.","This hotel is the cheapest in the town.","This is the cheapest hotel in the town.","In this town, this hotel is the cheapest.","In this town this hotel is the cheapest.","In this town, this is the cheapest hotel.","In this town this is the cheapest hotel.","In this town, this hotel is the least expensive.","In this town this hotel is the least expensive.","In this town, this is the least expensive hotel.","In this town this is the least expensive hotel.","In town, this hotel is the cheapest.","In town this hotel is the cheapest.","In town, this is the cheapest hotel.","In town this is the cheapest hotel.","In town, this hotel is the least expensive.","In town this hotel is the least expensive.","In town, this is the least expensive hotel.","In town this is the least expensive hotel.","In the town, this hotel is the cheapest.","In the town this hotel is the cheapest.","In the town, this is the cheapest hotel.","In the town this is the cheapest hotel."],"explanation":"この町で gives the comparison group, “in this town.” 一番安い means “the cheapest,” not just “cheaper.”","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"location group + 一番 + adjective"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-2007-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbcc