hat an employee would be dismissed, their colleagues wanted to know the reason.” Start with “社員を解雇するという” and end with “知りたがっていました。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"社員を解雇するという知らせを受けて、同僚たちは理由を知りたがっていました。","accepted_answers":["社員を解雇するという知らせを受けて、理由を同僚たちは知りたがっていました。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["社員を","解雇するという","知らせを受けて、","同僚たちは","理由を","知りたがって","いました。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["プレゼンテーション","発表"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Pay","Wages"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["クビにする"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0003-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Colleague","correct_answer":"同僚","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["同僚"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “At the meeting, my coworker proposed changing the plan to save time.” Start with “会議で、同僚は” and end with “変えようと提案しました。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"会議で、同僚は時間を節約するために計画を変えようと提案しました。","accepted_answers":["会議で、同僚は計画を時間を節約するために変えようと提案しました。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["会議で、","同僚は","時間を","節約するために","計画を","変えようと","提案しました。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3002-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["給与","サラリー","俸給"]}},{"tabl