 the hike we had been looking forward to.” Start with “天気が悪かったので、” and end with “キャンセルすることになりました。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"天気が悪かったので、楽しみにしていた山登りをキャンセルすることになりました。","metadata":{"tiles":["天気が","悪かったので、","楽しみに","していた","山登りを","キャンセルすることに","なりました。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Boarding card"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["取り消す"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0005-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Adventure","correct_answer":"冒険","metadata":{"tiles":["冒険"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “On my first adventure trip, I got lost, so I checked the map.” Start with “初めての冒険旅行で、” and end with “地図を確認しました。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"初めての冒険旅行で、道に迷ってしまったので、地図を確認しました。","metadata":{"tiles":["初めての","冒険旅行で、","道に","迷って","しまったので、","地図を","確認しました。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["ボーディングパス"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Hold-up","Lateness"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["アドベンチャー"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3003-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Tourist","correct_answer":"観光客","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["観光客"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Because there were many tourists, we could not get a room without making an advance reservation.” Start with “観光客が多かったため、” and end with “取ることができませんでした。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"観光客が多かったため、予約しておかなければ部屋を取ることができませんでした。","accepted_answers":["観光客が多かったため、部屋を予約しておかなければ取ることができませんでした。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["観光客が","多かったため、","予約して","おかなければ","部屋を","取ることが","できませんでした。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Recycle"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["森林"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["海洋","大洋"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Endangered","correct_answer":"絶滅危惧","metadata":{"tiles":["絶滅危惧"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Because of climate change, there are fewer and fewer places where endangered species live.” Start with “気候の変化によって、” and end with “減ってきています。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"気候の変化によって、絶滅危惧種が暮らす場所が減ってきています。","metada