ercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0006-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0006-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["陽光の"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3004-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Wildlife","correct_answer":"野生動物","metadata":{"tiles":["野生動物"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Even if you see wild animals, it is important to observe them from a distance without feeding them.” Start with “野生動物を見かけても、” and end with “観察することが大切です。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"野生動物を見かけても、食べ物を与えずに離れた所から観察することが大切です。","metadata":{"tiles":["野生動物を","見かけても、","食べ物を","与えずに","離れた所から","観察することが","大切です。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["サイト","ホームページ"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Application","Software application"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["ダウンロードをする"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: To upload","correct_answer":"アップロードする","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["アップロードする"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Before uploading a photo, I make a point of asking the people shown whether it is all right to make it public.” Start with “写真をアップロードする前に、” and end with “確認するようにしています。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"写真をアップロードする前に、写っている人に公開してもいいか確認するようにしています。","accepted_answers":["写真をアップロードする前に、公開してもいいか写っている人に確認するようにしています。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["写真を","アップロードする前に、","写っている","人に","公開してもいいか","確認するように","しています。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["アプリケーション"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["アップロードをする","アップする"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0002-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Screen","correct_answer":"画面","metadata":{"tiles":["画面"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “If the screen is small and the text is hard to read, you can change the text size in the settings.” Start with “画面が小さくて” and end with “文字の大きさを変えられます。”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"画面が小さくて文字が読みにくい場合は、設定で文字の大きさを変えられます。","metadata":{"tiles":["画面が","小さくて","文字が","読みにくい場合は、","設定で","文字の大きさを","変えられます。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Download"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["スクリーン","ディスプレイ"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-6666-3005-0003-e00000000006"