 I informed the hotel in advance that I would arrive late.” Start with “비행기 지연” and end with “미리 연락했어요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"비행기 지연 때문에 도착이 늦어진다고 호텔에 미리 연락했어요.","accepted_answers":["비행기 지연 때문에 호텔에 도착이 늦어진다고 미리 연락했어요."],"metadata":{"tiles":["비행기","지연","때문에","도착이","늦어진다고","호텔에","미리","연락했어요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Bags"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["연착","지체"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0004-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: To cancel","correct_answer":"취소하다","metadata":{"tiles":["취소하다"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Because the weather was bad, I ended up canceling the hike I had been looking forward to and felt very disappointed.” Start with “날씨가 나빠서” and end with “무척 아쉬웠어요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"날씨가 나빠서 기대하던 등산을 취소하게 되어 무척 아쉬웠어요.","metadata":{"tiles":["날씨가","나빠서","기대하던","등산을","취소하게","되어","무척","아쉬웠어요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["수하물"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Boarding card"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3003-0005-b10000000000",