ercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0005-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Carbon","correct_answer":"탄소","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["탄소"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “To reduce carbon emissions, I am commuting by bicycle whenever possible.” Start with “탄소 배출을” and end with “출퇴근하고 있어요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"탄소 배출을 줄이려고 가능하면 자전거로 출퇴근하고 있어요.","accepted_answers":["탄소 배출을 줄이려고 자전거로 가능하면 출퇴근하고 있어요."],"metadata":{"tiles":["탄소","배출을","줄이려고","가능하면","자전거로","출퇴근하고","있어요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["보호","보존"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3004-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Wildlife","correct_answer":"야생동물","metadata":{"tiles":["야생동물"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Even if you come across wild animals, it is a good idea to observe them from a distance without feeding them.” Start with “야생 동물을” and end with “것이 좋아요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"야생 동물을 만나더라도 먹이를 주지 말고 멀리서 관찰하는 것이 좋아요.","metadata":{"tiles":["야생","동물을","만나더라도","먹이를","주지","말고","멀리서","관찰하는","것이","좋아요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["누리집","사이트"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Ap