h “화면이 작아” and end with “키워 보세요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"화면이 작아 글씨가 잘 보이지 않으면 설정에서 크기를 키워 보세요.","accepted_answers":["화면이 작아 글씨가 잘 보이지 않으면 크기를 설정에서 키워 보세요."],"metadata":{"tiles":["화면이","작아","글씨가","잘","보이지","않으면","설정에서","크기를","키워","보세요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["암호","패스워드"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Download"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["스크린"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0003-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Keyboard","correct_answer":"키보드","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["키보드"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “When typing with a keyboard, I try to check for typos before sending.” Start with “키보드로 입력할” and end with “확인하려고 노력해요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"키보드로 입력할 때는 보내기 전에 오타가 없는지 확인하려고 노력해요.","accepted_answers":["키보드로 입력할 때는 오타가 없는지 보내기 전에 확인하려고 노력해요."],"metadata":{"tiles":["키보드로","입력할","때는","보내기","전에","오타가","없는지","확인하려고","노력해요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["내려받다"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3005-0004-b10000000000","type":"transl