 my regards","Please pass on my regards","Pass on my regards","Please send my regards","Send my regards"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["멋있는"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Awesome","correct_answer":"대박","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["대박"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “This movie is really awesome! I did not expect the main character to come back at the end.” Start with “이번 영화” and end with “줄 몰랐어.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"이번 영화 진짜 대박이야. 마지막에 주인공이 다시 나올 줄 몰랐어.","accepted_answers":["이번 영화 진짜 대박이야. 주인공이 마지막에 다시 나올 줄 몰랐어.","이번 영화 진짜 대박이야. 주인공이 다시 마지막에 나올 줄 몰랐어."],"metadata":{"tiles":["이번","영화","진짜","대박이야.","마지막에","주인공이","다시","나올","줄","몰랐어."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"dictation","correct_answer":"걱정마"},"after":{"correct_answer":"걱정 마"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Korean: Regards"},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Korean: Please give my regards"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Somewhat","A little","A bit","Slightly"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["있는"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["굉장한","끝내주는"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Whatever","correct_answer":"상관없어","metadata":{"tiles":["상관없어"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “In the work email, I will write “Either option is fine” instead of “It does not matter.”” Start with “업무 메일에는” and end with “괜찮습니다”라고 쓰겠습니다.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"업무 메일에는 “상관없어” 대신 “어느 쪽이든 괜찮습니다”라고 쓰겠습니다.","metadata":{"tiles":["업무","메일에는","“상관없어”","대신","“어느","쪽이든","괜찮습니다”라고","쓰겠습니다."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0003-b10000000000","type":"error_correction","correct_answer":"걱정마"},"after":{"correct_answer":"걱정 마"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","correct_answer":"Regards","options":["Whatever","No worries","Dude","Regards"]},"after":{"correct_answer":"Please give my regards","options":["Whatever","No worries","Dude","Please give my regards"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["좀","다소","조금"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Wonderful","Great","Stylish"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["뭐든 상관없어","뭐든지"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0004-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: No worries","correct_answer":"걱정마","metadata":{"tiles":["걱정마"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “On the phone, I told the customer not to worry and promised to check soon and call them back.” Start with “전화로 고객에게” and end with “연락드리겠다고 약속했어요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"전화로 고객에게 걱정하지 마시라고 말씀드리고 곧 확인해서 연락드리겠다고 약속했어요.","metadata":{"tiles":["전화로","고객에게","걱정하지","마시라고","말씀드리고","곧","확인해서","연락드리겠다고","약속했어요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["멋있는"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Amazing","Jackpot","Great success"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","correct_answer":"걱정마"},"after":{"correct_answer":"걱정 마"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Dude","correct_answer":"야","metadata":{"tiles":["야"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “When getting an adult’s attention, “excuse me” is more polite than “hey.”” Start with “어른에게 말을” and end with “더 공손해요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"어른에게 말을 걸 때는 “야”보다 “실례합니다”가 더 공손해요.","metadata":{"tiles":["어른에게","말을","걸","때는","“야”보다","“실례합니다”가","더","공손해요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0005-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","correct_answer":"Dear Sir","options":["Sincerely","Awesome","Dear Sir","Kind of"]},"after":{"correct_answer":"Respected ... (before a name or title)","options":["Sincerely","Awesome","Respected ... (before a name or title)","Kind of"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["굉장한","끝내주는"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["I don’t care","I do not care","It doesn’t matter","It does not matter"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","correct_answer":"정마"},"after":{"correct_answer":"정 마"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["이봐","친구야"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Formal","correct_answer":"공식적","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["공식적"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “Even with a close friend, you should adjust your way of speaking to the situation in a formal setting.” Start with “친한 친구와도” and end with “조절해야 해요.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"친한 친구와도 공식적인 자리에서는 상황에 맞게 말투를 조절해야 해요.","accepted_answers":["친한 친구와도 공식적인 자리에서는 말투를 상황에 맞게 조절해야 해요."],"metadata":{"tiles":["친한","친구와도","공식적인","자리에서는","상황에","맞게","말투를","조절해야","해요."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-3008-0006-b10000000000","type":"free_production","prompt":"Write a sentence using the word: 존경하는 (Dear Sir)"},"after":{"prompt":"Write a sentence using 존경하는 (respected; placed before a person’s name or title)."}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Aim","Objective","Intention"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-b20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["동등"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0001-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Truth","correct_answer":"진실","metadata":{"tiles":["진실"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “What we believe to be true is not necessarily grounded in objective facts.” Start with “우리가 진실이라고” and end with “것은 아닙니다.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"우리가 진실이라고 믿는 것이 반드시 객관적인 사실에 근거하는 것은 아닙니다.","metadata":{"tiles":["우리가","진실이라고","믿는","것이","반드시","객관적인","사실에","근거하는","것은","아닙니다."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0002-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["의도"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4001-0002-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Awareness"]}},{"table":"e