00000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["평론","비평"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0003-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0003-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Masterpiece","correct_answer":"걸작","metadata":{"tiles":["걸작"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “This film is regarded as a masterpiece because both its visuals and its script are excellent.” Start with “이 영화가” and end with “뛰어나기 때문입니다.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"이 영화가 걸작으로 평가받는 것은 영상뿐 아니라 각본도 뛰어나기 때문입니다.","metadata":{"tiles":["이","영화가","걸작으로","평가받는","것은","영상뿐","아니라","각본도","뛰어나기","때문입니다."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"조각\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Sculpture","options":["Sculpture","Painting","Novel","Protagonist"]},"after":{"prompt":"What does \"선율\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Melody","options":["Harmony","Melody","Rhythm","Silence"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["은유법"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["명작"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Inspiration","correct_answer":"영감","metadata":{"tiles":["영감"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “The composer is said to have created this piece after drawing inspiration from the scenery of their hometown.” Start with “작곡가는 고향” and end with “만들었다고 합니다.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"작곡가는 고향 풍경에서 영감을 얻어 이 곡을 만들었다고 합니다.","metadata":{"tiles":["작곡가는","고향","풍경에서","영감을","얻어","이","곡을","만들었다고","합니다."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0004-b20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"소설\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Novel","options":["Review","Masterpiece","Novel","Painting"]},"after":{"prompt":"What does \"리듬\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Rhythm","options":["Rhythm","Silence","Melody","Volume"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["상징법"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Type","Category"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-e00000000009","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0005-b20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Novel","correct_answer":"소설","metadata":{"tiles":["소설"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every tile to translate: “When writing a novel, it is important to show changes in the characters rather than merely list events.” Start with “소설을 쓸” and end with “것이 중요합니다.”. Use each tile once.","correct_answer":"소설을 쓸 때는 사건을 나열하기보다 인물의 변화를 보여주는 것이 중요합니다.","metadata":{"tiles":["소설을","쓸","때는","사건을","나열하기보다","인물의","변화를","보여주는","것이","중요합니다."],"distractors":[]}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-7777-4004-0006-b20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["갈래","유형"]}},