医师"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Soccer","correct_answer":"足球","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: waiter (a person who serves customers in a restaurant). Give the job title.","correct_answer":"服务员","accepted_answers":["服務員","服务生","服務生","侍者"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 热","correct_answer":"Hot","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English: 厨师 (a person whose job is to prepare food). Give the noun without an article.","correct_answer":"Cook","accepted_answers":["Chef"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0001-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","prompt":"Fill in the missing word: _____ means Cold","correct_answer":"冷","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null},"after":{"prompt":"面包_____ (Baker: enter the one missing Chinese character.)","correct_answer":"师","accepted_answers":["師"],"hint_text":"The complete job title is 面包师, or 麵包師 in traditional characters."}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"医生\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Doctor","options":["To cook","Teacher","Doctor","Friend"],"distractors":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary"},"after":{"prompt":"Read this sentence:\n我打算明天在公园见小红。\n\nWhat plan is described?","correct_answer":"Meeting Xiaohong in the park tomorrow.","options":["Meeting Xiaohong at a café tomorrow.","Meeting Xiaohong in the park today.","Staying at home tomorrow.","Meeting Xiaohong in the park tomorrow."],"distractors":["Meeting Xiaohong at a café tomorrow.","Meeting Xiaohong in the park today.","Staying at home tomorrow."],"hint_text":"打算 states a plan; 明天 means tomorrow; 在公园 means in the park. 小红 is Xiaohong.","explanation":"The speaker plans to meet Xiaohong in the park tomorrow. 打算 explicitly marks intention, and the following time and place phrases specify the planned meeting.","skill_type":"mixed"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["To read books","To study"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["菜"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0002-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["季"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"办公室\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Office","options":["Winter","Doctor","Summer","Office"],"distractors":[]},"after":{"prompt":"Read: “夏天，我喜欢在公园画画。” Which hobby does the speaker enjoy?","correct_answer":"Drawing","options":["Swimming","Cooking","Drawing","Reading"],"distractors":["Swimming","Cooking","Reading"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["读","阅读","看书"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["To prepare food"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["寒冷"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0003-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["季"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["烹饪","做菜","煮饭"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Football"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["夏季","夏"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0005-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0005-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["寒冷"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0005-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["冬季","冬"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0006-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0006-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["季"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0006-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1005-0006-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["师"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["父亲","爸"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0001-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Grandma","Paternal grandmother"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"爸爸\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Father","options":["Cat","Family","Father","Dog"],"distractors":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary"},"after":{"prompt":"Read this sentence:\n我爸爸的眼睛是棕色的，头发很短。\n\nWhich description matches the sentence?","correct_answer":"The father has brown eyes and short hair.","options":["The father has blue eyes and short hair.","The father has brown eyes and short hair.","The father has brown eyes and long hair.","The father has green eyes and long hair."],"distractors":["The father has blue eyes and short hair.","The father has brown eyes and long hair.","The father has green eyes and long hair."],"hint_text":"棕色 means brown; 头发很短 describes short hair.","explanation":"The speaker’s father has brown eyes and short hair. 眼睛 refers to the eyes and 头发 to the hair. The sentence describes appearance, not a family relationship alone.","skill_type":"mixed"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["姐姐","妹妹","姊妹"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["祖母"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Grandpa","Paternal grandfather"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0002-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["人"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"姐妹\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Sister","options":["Son","Sister","Brother","Grandmother"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"You are speaking directly to a young child. Which question asks how old the child is?","correct_answer":"你几岁了？","options":["你叫什么名字？","你的生日是几月几号？","你几岁了？","你住在哪里？"],"hint_text":"岁 is the measure used for years of age.","explanation":"你几岁了？ asks a young child’s age. The other questions ask the child’s name, birthday date and home location. This is a child-directed example, not a rule for addressing every adult.","distractors":["你叫什么名字？","你的生日是几月几号？","你住在哪里？"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_expressions"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Brother","correct_answer":"兄弟","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: I am eight years old. Use 我 and 岁; write the number in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"我八岁。","accepted_answers":["我八岁了。","我今年八岁。","我今年八岁了。","我八歲。","我八歲了。","我今年八歲。","我今年八歲了。"],"hint_text":"Put 八 before 岁. This ordinary age statement does not need 是.","explanation":"我八岁 states that I am eight years old. 我八岁了 and the ordinary current-age expression 我今年八岁 are also accepted. 岁 follows the age number; no 是 is needed in the neutral age predicate.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_expressions"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 女儿","correct_answer":"Daughter","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English: 他八岁了。","correct_answer":"He is eight years old.","accepted_answers":["He is eight.","He's eight years old.","He's eight.","He is 8 years old.","He is 8.","He's 8 years old.","He's 8.","He is now eight years old.","He is eight years old now.","He's now eight years old.","He's eight years old now."],"hint_text":"他 means he; 八岁 gives his current age.","explanation":"He is eight years old. Final 了 presents the age as the current situation and may be rendered with now; it does not make this an English past-tense sentence.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_expressions"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"儿_____ (Son)","correct_answer":"子","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"小红十___。 (Xiaohong is ten years old.) Enter the one-character age measure.","correct_answer":"岁","accepted_answers":["歲"],"hint_text":"Use the measure for years of age, not the word for a calendar year.","explanation":"小红十岁。 The age measure 岁 comes after 十, ten. 歲 is its traditional written form.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_expressions"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"奶奶\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Grandmother","options":["Sister","Grandmother","Daughter","Brother"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"小明的生日是五月三号。小红的生日是六月八号。When is Xiaohong’s (小红) birthday?","correct_answer":"On June 8.","options":["On May 3.","On June 8.","On June 3.","On May 8."],"hint_text":"Find 小红’s sentence. 六月 is June; 八号 is the eighth day.","explanation":"Xiaohong’s birthday is on June 8; Xiaoming’s is on May 3. Chinese gives the month before the day: 六月八号. 日 can also mark the day of the month.","distractors":["On May 3.","On June 3.","On May 8."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"birthday_dates"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Grandfather","correct_answer":"爷爷","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: My birthday is on June eighth. Use 是 and 我的生日; write all numbers in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"我的生日是六月八号。","accepted_answers":["我的生日是六月八日。","六月八号是我的生日。","六月八日是我的生日。","我的生日是六月八號。","六月八號是我的生日。"],"hint_text":"Use 六月八号 or 六月八日 for June eighth.","explanation":"我的生日是六月八号 and 我的生日是六月八日 both state the birthday date using the requested 是. Chinese puts month before day. 號 is the traditional written form of 号.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"birthday_dates"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["家","家人"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0005-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0005-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"女儿\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Daughter","options":["Sister","Daughter","Cat","Son"],"distractors":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary"},"after":{"prompt":"Read this sentence:\n每个星期天，我都和女儿一起做饭。\n\nWhich shared family activity is described?","correct_answer":"Cooking with the speaker’s daughter every Sunday.","options":["Cooking with the speaker’s daughter every Sunday.","Reading with the speaker’s daughter every Sunday.","Cooking with the speaker’s mother every Sunday.","Cooking with the speaker’s daughter every Friday."],"distractors":["Reading with the speaker’s daughter every Sunday.","Cooking with the speaker’s mother every Sunday.","Cooking with the speaker’s daughter every Friday."],"hint_text":"每个星期天 means every Sunday; 和女儿一起做饭 means cook together with my daughter in this context.","explanation":"The speaker cooks with their daughter every Sunday. 和...一起 makes the shared activity explicit; 女儿 can refer to the speaker’s own daughter without repeating 我的 here.","skill_type":"mixed"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0005-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Grandma","Paternal grandmother"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["祖母"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Grandpa","Paternal grandfather"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["人"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1006-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Mom","Mum","Mommy"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["屋子"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Restroom","Toilet","Lavatory"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["房"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["窗"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Bathroom","correct_answer":"洗手间"},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: bowl (a round container used for eating rice or soup). Give the noun.","correct_answer":"碗"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 卧室","correct_answer":"Bedroom","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English: 盘子 (the item you eat from). Give the noun without an article.","correct_answer":"Plate","accepted_answers":["Dish"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["桌"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0003-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","prompt":"Fill in the missing word: _____ means Bed","correct_answer":"床"},"after":{"prompt":"叉_____ (Fork: enter the one missing Chinese character.)","correct_answer":"子"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["卧房"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Gate"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["椅"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0005-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0005-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"卧室\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Bedroom","options":["Bed","Bedroom","Chair","Table"],"distractors":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary"},"after":{"prompt":"Read this sentence:\n我家有两间卧室和一个花园。\n\nWhich description matches the stated details?","correct_answer":"The home has two bedrooms and a garden.","options":["The home has one bedroom and a garden.","The home has two bedrooms but no garden.","The home has two bedrooms and a garden.","The home has three bedrooms and a garden."],"distractors":["The home has one bedroom and a garden.","The home has two bedrooms but no garden.","The home has three bedrooms and a garden."],"hint_text":"两间卧室 means two bedrooms; 一个花园 means a garden.","explanation":"The home has two bedrooms and a garden. 有 states what the home has; 间 counts the bedrooms. The other offered descriptions change the bedroom count or wrongly remove the garden.","skill_type":"mixed"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0005-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0005-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["屋"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["窗"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1007-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["园子","庭园"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Eyes"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["肚子"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0001-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Medication","Drug"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["眼"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["药物","药品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Ache"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0002-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["热"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["肚子"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Ill","To be ill","To get sick"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["痛","疼"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0003-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["To have a fever","Have a fever"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["患病","病了"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["药物","药品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0004-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["发热"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-000000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"生病\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Sick","options":["Head","Hand","Medicine","Sick"],"distractors":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary"},"after":{"prompt":"Read this sentence:\n我每天都去散步。\n\nWhich habit does the speaker describe?","correct_answer":"Going for a walk every day.","options":["Going swimming every day.","Going for a walk once a week.","Drinking water every morning.","Going for a walk every day."],"distractors":["Going swimming every day.","Going for a walk once a week.","Drinking water every morning."],"hint_text":"散步 means go for a walk; 每天 means every day.","explanation":"The speaker goes for a walk every day. This sentence describes a recurring personal activity. It does not prescribe a medical treatment, duration or exercise target.","skill_type":"mixed"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Medication","Drug"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["手臂","臂"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0005-000000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["头部"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["药物","药品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-000000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Ache"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-1008-0006-000000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["热"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["姨妈"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Male cousins"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Husband","correct_answer":"丈夫","metadata":{"tiles":["丈夫"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “My husband has two older sisters.” Start with “我” and end with “姐姐。”.","correct_answer":"我丈夫有两个姐姐。","metadata":{"tiles":["我","丈夫","有","两个","姐姐。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["男友"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["表哥","表弟"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["老公"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Wife","correct_answer":"妻子","metadata":{"tiles":["妻子"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “His wife is my best friend.” Start with “他的妻子” and end with “朋友。”.","correct_answer":"他的妻子是我最好的朋友。","metadata":{"tiles":["他的妻子","是","我","最好的","朋友。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0002-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["女友"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"表兄弟\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Cousin","options":["Niece","Boyfriend","Neighbor","Cousin"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"小明二十五岁，小红二十二岁。Which sentence correctly compares Xiaoming’s and Xiaohong’s ages?","correct_answer":"小明比小红大三岁。","options":["小明比小红小三岁。","小明比小红大三岁。","小明和小红一样大。","小明比小红大两岁。"],"hint_text":"For age, 大 means older and 小 means younger. Compare twenty-five with twenty-two.","explanation":"小明比小红大三岁。 Xiaoming is three years older than Xiaohong. The age difference 三岁 follows 大; the 比 phrase names the person being compared with Xiaoming.","distractors":["小明比小红小三岁。","小明和小红一样大。","小明比小红大两岁。"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Nephew","correct_answer":"侄子","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: My older brother is three years older than me. Use 哥哥 and 比; write the number in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"我哥哥比我大三岁。","accepted_answers":["我的哥哥比我大三岁。","哥哥比我大三岁。","我哥哥比我大三歲。","我的哥哥比我大三歲。","哥哥比我大三歲。","哥哥比我年长三岁。","我哥哥比我年长三岁。","我的哥哥比我年长三岁。","哥哥比我年長三歲。","我哥哥比我年長三歲。","我的哥哥比我年長三歲。"],"hint_text":"Place 比我 before 大 and 三岁 after it. 的 can be omitted with a close family relationship.","explanation":"我哥哥比我大三岁。 This says that my older brother is older by three years, not that he is three years old. 我的哥哥 is also valid; in this family context, 哥哥 alone can refer to my older brother.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 侄女","correct_answer":"Niece","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English using turned and the name Xiaohong: 小红昨天满二十二岁了。","correct_answer":"Xiaohong turned twenty-two yesterday.","accepted_answers":["Xiaohong turned 22 yesterday.","Yesterday Xiaohong turned twenty-two.","Yesterday, Xiaohong turned twenty-two.","Yesterday Xiaohong turned 22.","Yesterday, Xiaohong turned 22.","Xiaohong turned twenty-two years old yesterday.","Xiaohong turned 22 years old yesterday.","Yesterday Xiaohong turned twenty-two years old.","Yesterday, Xiaohong turned twenty-two years old.","Yesterday Xiaohong turned 22 years old.","Yesterday, Xiaohong turned 22 years old."],"hint_text":"昨天 means yesterday; 满二十二岁 means reaching the age of twenty-two.","explanation":"Xiaohong turned twenty-two yesterday. 满 states that she reached the age; the time word 昨天 locates the birthday event. Chinese does not require an inflected past-tense verb.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"reaching_an_age"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"丈_____ (Husband)","correct_answer":"夫","hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"小明二十五岁，小红二十二岁。Complete with 大 or 小: 小明比小红___三岁。","correct_answer":"大","hint_text":"Xiaoming is older, not younger, by three years.","explanation":"小明比小红大三岁。 The stated ages select 大 for older. 三岁 gives the age difference after the adjective, not before 比.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["老婆","太太"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Boyfriend","correct_answer":"男朋友","metadata":{"tiles":["男朋友"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “My boyfriend has just turned twenty this year.” Start with “我的男朋友” and end with “岁。”.","correct_answer":"我的男朋友今年刚满二十岁。","metadata":{"tiles":["我的男朋友","今年","刚满","二十","岁。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"女朋友\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Girlfriend","options":["Married","Aunt","Girlfriend","Neighbor"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"You are chatting with a friend about the friend’s adult older sister. Which question asks the sister’s age?","correct_answer":"你姐姐多大了？","options":["你姐姐叫什么名字？","你姐姐做什么工作？","你姐姐的生日是几月几号？","你姐姐多大了？"],"hint_text":"多大 asks how old in this adult-age context.","explanation":"你姐姐多大了？ asks the older sister’s age. The other questions ask her name, occupation and birthday date. Here 多大 is about age, not physical size.","distractors":["你姐姐叫什么名字？","你姐姐做什么工作？","你姐姐的生日是几月几号？"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"age_questions"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Neighbor","correct_answer":"邻居","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Yesterday I turned twenty-two. Use 我 and 满; write the age in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"我昨天满二十二岁了。","accepted_answers":["昨天我满二十二岁了。","我昨天满了二十二岁。","昨天我满了二十二岁。","我昨天满二十二岁。","昨天我满二十二岁。","我昨天滿二十二歲了。","昨天我滿二十二歲了。","我昨天滿了二十二歲。","昨天我滿了二十二歲。","我昨天滿二十二歲。","昨天我滿二十二歲。","昨天，我满二十二岁了。","昨天，我满了二十二岁。","昨天，我满二十二岁。","昨天，我滿二十二歲了。","昨天，我滿了二十二歲。","昨天，我滿二十二歲。"],"hint_text":"Use 满二十二岁 for reaching age twenty-two. 昨天 can precede or follow 我.","explanation":"我昨天满二十二岁了。 The visible time word 昨天 fixes the event in the past. The accepted forms allow ordinary variation in 了 and time-word placement; 满 states that the age was reached. 滿 and 歲 are traditional forms.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"reaching_an_age"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0004-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["男友"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0004-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Girlfriend","correct_answer":"女朋友","metadata":{"tiles":["女朋友"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “My girlfriend moved to Beijing for work last year.” Start with “我的女朋友” and end with “工作了。”.","correct_answer":"我的女朋友去年搬到北京工作了。","metadata":{"tiles":["我的女朋友","去年","搬到","北京","工作了。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2001-0005-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["老公"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-200