国","旅行。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2006-0006-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2006-0006-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["明日"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["糟","糟糕","坏"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更廉价"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: More expensive","correct_answer":"更贵","metadata":{"tiles":["更贵"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “This bicycle is more expensive than that one, but it is also lighter.” Start with “这辆自行车” and end with “也更轻。”.","correct_answer":"这辆自行车比那辆更贵，但是也更轻。","metadata":{"tiles":["这辆自行车","比","那辆","更贵，","但是","也更轻。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更短"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["廉价"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更昂贵"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0002-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Taller","correct_answer":"更高","metadata":{"tiles":["更高"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “My younger brother is taller than me, but he is younger than me.” Start with “我弟弟” and end with “比我小。”.","correct_answer":"我弟弟比我更高，但是年纪比我小。","metadata":{"tiles":["我弟弟","比我","更高，","但是","年纪","比我小。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"更好\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Better","options":["Better","Taller","Shorter","The worst"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"住一晚：A酒店60元，B酒店80元，C酒店100元。Which sentence identifies the cheapest of these three hotels?","correct_answer":"A酒店最便宜。","options":["B酒店最便宜。","A酒店最贵。","C酒店最便宜。","A酒店最便宜。"],"hint_text":"The cheapest hotel has the lowest price. 最 marks the extreme in this group.","explanation":"A酒店 costs the least, so it is 最便宜, the cheapest. 更便宜 means cheaper; 最便宜 identifies the minimum price in this three-hotel set.","distractors":["B酒店最便宜。","A酒店最贵。","C酒店最便宜。"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Worse","correct_answer":"更差","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Hotel A is the cheapest of the three hotels. Use 中, 酒店, 最 and 便宜; write three in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","accepted_answers":["在三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","A酒店在三家酒店中最便宜。","A酒店是三家酒店中最便宜的。","这三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","在这三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","A酒店在这三家酒店中最便宜。","A酒店是这三家酒店中最便宜的。","這三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","在這三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。","A酒店在這三家酒店中最便宜。","A酒店是這三家酒店中最便宜的。","三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","在三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","这三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","在这三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","這三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","在這三家酒店中A酒店最便宜。","三家酒店中最便宜的是A酒店。"],"hint_text":"Use 最 before 便宜; 三家酒店中 gives the comparison set.","explanation":"三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。 This states the lowest price in the group. A酒店是三家酒店中最便宜的 is also valid. 最, not 更, supplies the requested superlative meaning.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 更便宜","correct_answer":"Cheaper","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"We are comparing three hotels. Translate to English: C酒店最贵。","correct_answer":"Hotel C is the most expensive hotel.","accepted_answers":["Hotel C is the most expensive.","Hotel C is the priciest hotel.","Hotel C is the priciest.","Hotel C is the costliest hotel.","Hotel C is the costliest."],"hint_text":"最贵 gives the highest price, not just a higher price.","explanation":"Hotel C is the most expensive. 最贵 expresses the maximum price within the comparison set; more expensive would translate a comparative rather than this superlative.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"更_____ (More expensive)","correct_answer":"贵","hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"三家酒店中，A酒店___便宜。Complete with the one-character superlative marker meaning most.","correct_answer":"最","hint_text":"Use the marker for the extreme in the group, not 更 for a further comparison.","explanation":"三家酒店中，A酒店最便宜。 最 comes before 便宜 and makes the meaning the cheapest. No adjective suffix or definite article is added.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Shorter","correct_answer":"更矮","metadata":{"tiles":["更矮"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “This building is shorter than that one, but it has the largest garden.” Start with “这栋楼” and end with “最大的花园。”.","correct_answer":"这栋楼比那栋更矮，但是有最大的花园。","metadata":{"tiles":["这栋楼","比那栋","更矮，","但是","有","最大的花园。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"更快\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Faster","options":["Faster","The worst","Shorter","Smaller"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"三列火车跑同一段路：A车用50分钟，B车用40分钟，C车用30分钟。Which sentence names the slowest of the three trains?","correct_answer":"A车最慢。","options":["C车最慢。","A车最慢。","B车最慢。","A车最快。"],"hint_text":"For the same route, the train taking the most time is the slowest.","explanation":"A车 takes 50 minutes, the longest time for the same route, so it is 最慢. C车 takes the least time and is 最快.","distractors":["C车最慢。","B车最慢。","A车最快。"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Slower","correct_answer":"更慢","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Of the three trains, train C is the fastest. Train C is labeled C车. Use 中, 火车 and 最; write three in Chinese characters.","correct_answer":"三列火车中，C车最快。","accepted_answers":["在三列火车中，C车最快。","C车在三列火车中最快。","C车是三列火车中最快的。","这三列火车中，C车最快。","在这三列火车中，C车最快。","C车在这三列火车中最快。","C车是这三列火车中最快的。","三列火車中，C車最快。","在三列火車中，C車最快。","C車在三列火車中最快。","C車是三列火車中最快的。","這三列火車中，C車最快。","在這三列火車中，C車最快。","C車在這三列火車中最快。","C車是這三列火車中最快的。","三列火车中C车最快。","在三列火车中C车最快。","这三列火车中C车最快。","在这三列火车中C车最快。","三列火車中C車最快。","在三列火車中C車最快。","這三列火車中C車最快。","在這三列火車中C車最快。","三列火车中最快的是C车。","三列火車中最快的是C車。"],"hint_text":"Use 最快 for fastest and 三列火车中 for the comparison set.","explanation":"三列火车中，C车最快。 The label C车 identifies train C, and 最快 says it is fastest in the stated set. C车是三列火车中最快的 is another valid structure.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"superlative_comparison"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更廉价"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Costlier"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更短"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Faster","correct_answer":"更快","metadata":{"tiles":["更快"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “This computer is more expensive, but it runs faster and its screen is clearer.” Start with “这台电脑” and end with “也更清楚。”.","correct_answer":"这台电脑更贵，但是运行得更快，屏幕也更清楚。","metadata":{"tiles":["这台电脑","更贵，","但是","运行得","更快，","屏幕","也更清楚。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0004-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["最好的","最佳"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更昂贵"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Higher"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["短"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Slower","correct_answer":"更慢","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["更慢"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “I prefer to travel a little more slowly because that way I can see more scenery.” Start with “我” and end with “看到更多风景。”.","correct_answer":"我更喜欢走得更慢一点，因为这样可以看到更多风景。","accepted_answers":["我更喜欢走得更慢一点，因为可以这样看到更多风景。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["我","更喜欢","走得更慢一点，","因为","这样","可以","看到更多风景。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0005-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["最糟","最糟糕","最差的","最坏"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0006-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0006-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["更缓慢"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2007-0006-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: The best","correct_answer":"最好","metadata":{"tiles":["最好"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Of these three hotels, this one has the best service.” Start with “这三家酒店中，” and end with “最好。”.","correct_answer":"这三家酒店中，这家的服务最好。","metadata":{"tiles":["这三家酒店中，","这家","的","服务","最好。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["圣诞"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["习俗"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Gift","correct_answer":"礼物","metadata":{"tiles":["礼物"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “At the Spring Festival, I prepare a small gift for my grandmother.” Start with “春节的时候，” and end with “小礼物。”.","correct_answer":"春节的时候，我给奶奶准备一份小礼物。","metadata":{"tiles":["春节的时候，","我","给奶奶","准备","一份","小礼物。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0001-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["庆贺"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"圣诞节\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Christmas","options":["Christmas","Gift","To celebrate","Birthday"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Xiaoming describes his family: “过生日的时候，我们总是做蛋糕。” What food do they traditionally prepare for birthdays?","correct_answer":"Cake","options":["Rice","Fish","Cake","Bread"],"hint_text":"蛋糕 names the food; 总是 marks the recurring custom.","explanation":"They make a cake for birthdays. The statement describes Xiaoming’s family, not a rule for every Chinese-speaking family.","distractors":["Rice","Fish","Bread"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: New Year","correct_answer":"新年","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"A speaker describes their family custom. Translate to Chinese: On New Year’s Day, we always have soup. New Year’s Day = 元旦. Use 我们, 总是, 喝 and 汤.","correct_answer":"元旦我们总是喝汤。","accepted_answers":["我们元旦总是喝汤。","在元旦，我们总是喝汤。","我们在元旦总是喝汤。","元旦我們總是喝湯。","我們元旦總是喝湯。","在元旦，我們總是喝湯。","我們在元旦總是喝湯。","元旦，我们总是喝汤。","元旦，我們總是喝湯。","在元旦我们总是喝汤。","在元旦我們總是喝湯。"],"hint_text":"Chinese normally uses 喝 with soup. Place 总是 before the action.","explanation":"元旦我们总是喝汤 states this family’s recurring meal. 元旦 selects New Year’s Day here, not the Lunar New Year. 总是 marks always; 喝汤 is the ordinary soup expression.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 生日","correct_answer":"Birthday","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English: 我们每年都吃生日蛋糕。","correct_answer":"We eat birthday cake every year.","accepted_answers":["Every year, we eat birthday cake.","We eat a birthday cake every year.","Every year, we eat a birthday cake.","We eat birthday cake each year.","Each year, we eat birthday cake.","We eat a birthday cake each year.","Each year, we eat a birthday cake.","Every year we eat birthday cake.","Every year we eat a birthday cake.","Each year we eat birthday cake.","Each year we eat a birthday cake."],"hint_text":"每年都 expresses the yearly recurrence; 生日蛋糕 is birthday cake.","explanation":"We eat birthday cake every year. 每年都 links the repeated yearly occasion to the action; 都 need not become a separate all in this natural English sentence.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"传_____ (Tradition)","correct_answer":"统","hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Choose 都 or 不 to match “Every year we eat birthday cake”: 我们每年___吃生日蛋糕。","correct_answer":"都","hint_text":"The English statement affirms that the custom happens each year; it is not a negative.","explanation":"我们每年都吃生日蛋糕。 都 works with 每年 to express the recurring action. 不 would negate eating the cake, contradicting the English cue.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["礼品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Party","correct_answer":"派对","metadata":{"tiles":["派对"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “At our family party, Grandma always makes her special cake.” Start with “在我们家的派对上，” and end with “蛋糕。”.","correct_answer":"在我们家的派对上，奶奶总是做她拿手的蛋糕。","metadata":{"tiles":["在我们家的派对上，","奶奶","总是","做","她拿手的","蛋糕。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"庆祝\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"To celebrate","options":["To celebrate","Birthday","Party","Holiday"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Xiaoming says: “元旦，爸爸做汤，妈妈做米饭。” Who makes the soup?","correct_answer":"Xiaoming’s father","options":["Xiaoming’s mother","Xiaoming’s brother","Xiaoming’s father","Xiaoming’s grandmother"],"hint_text":"Match 汤 with the person named before 做汤.","explanation":"Xiaoming’s father makes soup; his mother makes rice. These are roles in this fictional family account, not a cultural rule about who cooks.","distractors":["Xiaoming’s mother","Xiaoming’s brother","Xiaoming’s grandmother"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0002-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Music","correct_answer":"音乐","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: My grandmother always makes a cake for my birthday. Use 奶奶, 总是, 做 and 蛋糕.","correct_answer":"我过生日时，奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","accepted_answers":["我过生日的时候，奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","我生日的时候，奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","奶奶总是在我生日的时候给我做蛋糕。","奶奶总是在我过生日的时候给我做蛋糕。","我的奶奶总是在我生日的时候给我做蛋糕。","我的奶奶总是在我过生日的时候给我做蛋糕。","我過生日時，奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","我過生日的時候，奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","我生日的時候，奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","奶奶總是在我生日的時候給我做蛋糕。","奶奶總是在我過生日的時候給我做蛋糕。","我的奶奶總是在我生日的時候給我做蛋糕。","我的奶奶總是在我過生日的時候給我做蛋糕。","我过生日时，奶奶总是给我做一个蛋糕。","我过生日的时候，奶奶总是给我做一个蛋糕。","奶奶总是在我生日的时候给我做一个蛋糕。","奶奶总是在我过生日的时候给我做一个蛋糕。","我过生日时，奶奶总是给我做个蛋糕。","我過生日時，奶奶總是給我做一個蛋糕。","我過生日的時候，奶奶總是給我做一個蛋糕。","奶奶總是在我生日的時候給我做一個蛋糕。","奶奶總是在我過生日的時候給我做一個蛋糕。","我過生日時，奶奶總是給我做個蛋糕。","我过生日时奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","我过生日的时候奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","我生日的时候奶奶总是给我做蛋糕。","我過生日時奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","我過生日的時候奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","我生日的時候奶奶總是給我做蛋糕。","我过生日时奶奶总是给我做一个蛋糕。","我过生日的时候奶奶总是给我做一个蛋糕。","我过生日时奶奶总是给我做个蛋糕。","我過生日時奶奶總是給我做一個蛋糕。","我過生日的時候奶奶總是給我做一個蛋糕。","我過生日時奶奶總是給我做個蛋糕。"],"hint_text":"State the birthday occasion, the grandmother and her recurring action. Use the requested 奶奶 term.","explanation":"我过生日时，奶奶总是给我做蛋糕 describes a family birthday custom. The selected 奶奶 refers to the paternal grandmother; this wording does not exclude different customs or relatives in other families. Chinese can make the personal relationship clear without repeating 我的 before 奶奶.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"habitual_food_customs"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["聚会"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: To celebrate","correct_answer":"庆祝","metadata":{"tiles":["庆祝"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “We celebrate this festival with music and traditional dances.” Start with “我们” and end with “这个节日。”.","correct_answer":"我们用音乐和传统舞蹈庆祝这个节日。","metadata":{"tiles":["我们","用","音乐","和传统舞蹈","庆祝","这个节日。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-e00000000008","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0003-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["舞蹈"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["习俗"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Present"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-a20000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["庆贺"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0004-a20000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Music","correct_answer":"音乐","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["音乐"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “During the festival, there are music performances in the square every evening.” Start with “节日期间，” and end with “表演。”.","correct_answer":"节日期间，每天晚上广场上都有音乐表演。","accepted_answers":["节日期间，广场上每天晚上都有音乐表演。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["节日期间，","每天晚上","广场上","都有","音乐","表演。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0005-a20000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["礼品"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0005-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0005-a20000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["贺"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-2008-0005-e00000000006",