":["这个项目","比","我们","原来预想的","花了","更多时间，","因为","出现了","几个","技术问题。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Luggage","correct_answer":"行李","metadata":{"tiles":["行李"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Before booking the flight, you had better first confirm whether the fare includes the cost of checked luggage.” Start with “订机票以前，” and end with “费用。”.","correct_answer":"订机票以前，你最好先确认票价里是否包括托运行李的费用。","metadata":{"tiles":["订机票以前，","你","最好","先","确认","票价里","是否","包括","托运行李的","费用。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["宾馆","旅馆","饭店"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":["Appointment"]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Appointment","Booking","To reserve"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0002-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Boarding pass","correct_answer":"登机牌","metadata":{"tiles":["登机牌"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Please have your boarding pass ready so that the staff at the gate can check it.” Start with “请” and end with “检查。”.","correct_answer":"请准备好您的登机牌，以便登机口的工作人员进行检查。","metadata":{"tiles":["请","准备好","您的","登机牌，","以便","登机口的工作人员","进行","检查。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3003-0003-b10000000000","typ