3","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["All of a sudden"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["时"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["先","第一"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Next","correct_answer":"接下来","metadata":{"tiles":["接下来"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “First we found an old map, and next we began looking for the house marked on it.” Start with “我们” and end with “那座房子。”.","correct_answer":"我们先找到了一张旧地图，接下来就开始寻找地图上标出的那座房子。","metadata":{"tiles":["我们","先","找到了一张","旧地图，","接下来","就","开始","寻找","地图上标出的","那座房子。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["忽然"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["When"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["接着"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0002-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Finally","correct_answer":"最后","metadata":{"tiles":["最后"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “We searched along the mountain path for several hours and finally reached the village before dark.” Start with “我们” and end with “那个村子。”.","correct_answer":"我们沿着山路找了几个小时，最后终于在天黑以前到达了那个村子。","metadata":{"tiles":["我们","沿着山路","找了","几个小时，","最后","终于","在天黑以前","到达了","那个村子。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"突然\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Suddenly","options":["Once upon a time","Beginning","Then","Suddenly"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"昨天晚上，小红正在看一本书，电话响了。What was Xiaohong doing when the phone rang?","correct_answer":"She was reading a book.","options":["She was reading a book.","She had finished the book.","She was cooking a meal.","She had not started reading."],"hint_text":"正在看一本书 describes the reading in progress; 昨天晚上 fixes the past scene.","explanation":"Xiaohong was reading a book. 正在 marks an ongoing action, not a past-tense ending. The past time phrase places this scene yesterday evening; the ringing happens during the reading.","distractors":["She had finished the book.","She was cooking a meal.","She had not started reading."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: While","correct_answer":"当…的时候","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"In a story about yesterday, translate to Chinese: I was reading a book when Xiaoming arrived. Start with 当小明...的时候 and use 到, 正在 and 一本书.","correct_answer":"当小明到的时候，我正在看一本书。","accepted_answers":["当小明到的时候我正在看一本书。","当小明到了的时候，我正在看一本书。","当小明到了的时候我正在看一本书。","当小明到的时候，我正在看一本书呢。","当小明到的时候我正在看一本书呢。","当小明到了的时候，我正在看一本书呢。","当小明到了的时候我正在看一本书呢。","當小明到的時候，我正在看一本書。","當小明到的時候我正在看一本書。","當小明到了的時候，我正在看一本書。","當小明到了的時候我正在看一本書。","當小明到的時候，我正在看一本書呢。","當小明到的時候我正在看一本書呢。","當小明到了的時候，我正在看一本書呢。","當小明到了的時候我正在看一本書呢。","当小明到的时候，我正在读一本书。","当小明到的时候我正在读一本书。","当小明到了的时候，我正在读一本书。","当小明到了的时候我正在读一本书。","当小明到的时候，我正在读一本书呢。","当小明到的时候我正在读一本书呢。","当小明到了的时候，我正在读一本书呢。","当小明到了的时候我正在读一本书呢。","當小明到的時候，我正在讀一本書。","當小明到的時候我正在讀一本書。","當小明到了的時候，我正在讀一本書。","當小明到了的時候我正在讀一本書。","當小明到的時候，我正在讀一本書呢。","當小明到的時候我正在讀一本書呢。","當小明到了的時候，我正在讀一本書呢。","當小明到了的時候我正在讀一本書呢。"],"hint_text":"The initial 当...的时候 clause supplies the arrival time. 正在 comes before 看.","explanation":"当小明到的时候，我正在看一本书。 The story context places the event in the past, and 正在 marks reading in progress at that time. 到了 and sentence-final 呢 are optional in the accepted versions; neither is an English-style tense inflection.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 首先","correct_answer":"First","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English using eating: 昨天八点，我们还在吃饭。","correct_answer":"We were still eating at eight yesterday.","accepted_answers":["We were still eating yesterday at eight.","Yesterday at eight, we were still eating.","Yesterday at eight we were still eating.","At eight yesterday, we were still eating.","At eight yesterday we were still eating.","Yesterday, we were still eating at eight.","Yesterday we were still eating at eight.","We were still eating at 8 yesterday.","We were still eating yesterday at 8.","Yesterday at 8, we were still eating.","Yesterday at 8 we were still eating.","At 8 yesterday, we were still eating.","At 8 yesterday we were still eating.","Yesterday, we were still eating at 8.","Yesterday we were still eating at 8.","We were still eating at eight o'clock yesterday.","We were still eating yesterday at eight o'clock.","Yesterday at eight o'clock, we were still eating.","Yesterday at eight o'clock we were still eating.","At eight o'clock yesterday, we were still eating.","At eight o'clock yesterday we were still eating.","Yesterday, we were still eating at eight o'clock.","Yesterday we were still eating at eight o'clock.","We were still eating at 8 o'clock yesterday.","We were still eating yesterday at 8 o'clock.","Yesterday at 8 o'clock, we were still eating.","Yesterday at 8 o'clock we were still eating.","At 8 o'clock yesterday, we were still eating.","At 8 o'clock yesterday we were still eating.","Yesterday, we were still eating at 8 o'clock.","Yesterday we were still eating at 8 o'clock."],"hint_text":"还在 gives still in progress. 昨天八点 means at eight yesterday.","explanation":"We were still eating at eight yesterday. 还 means still and 在 marks the ongoing eating. The explicit past time, not verb inflection, locates the meal yesterday. Morning or evening is not specified.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"接_____ (Next)","correct_answer":"下来","hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Choose 在 or 了 to mean “We were still eating at eight yesterday”: 昨天八点，我们还___吃饭。","correct_answer":"在","hint_text":"Use the progressive marker before the action 吃饭.","explanation":"昨天八点，我们还在吃饭。 在 marks the action in progress after 还. Putting 了 in this particular blank would not form the required progressive expression.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["终于","最终"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Meanwhile","correct_answer":"与此同时","metadata":{"tiles":["与此同时"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Dad was cooking in the kitchen, and meanwhile the children were playing happily in the garden.” Start with “爸爸” and end with “玩耍。”.","correct_answer":"爸爸正在厨房里做饭，与此同时，孩子们正在花园里开心地玩耍。","metadata":{"tiles":["爸爸","正在","厨房里","做饭，","与此同时，","孩子们","正","在花园里","开心地","玩耍。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"error_correction","prompt":"Find and correct the error: 人物x","metadata":{"error_sentence":"人物x"},"correct_answer":"人物","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Correct the placement of the progressive marker in the sentence.","metadata":{"error_sentence":"昨天八点，我正看在一本书。","correction_instruction":"Move 在 to complete the progressive marker 正在 before 看. Keep every other word and its order unchanged; return the complete corrected sentence."},"correct_answer":"昨天八点，我正在看一本书。","accepted_answers":["昨天八點，我正在看一本書。","昨天八点我正在看一本书。","昨天八點我正在看一本書。"],"hint_text":"正在 must precede the action 看; do not put 在 between 看 and its book object.","explanation":"昨天八点，我正在看一本书。 Move 在 from after 看 to after 正. The result describes reading in progress at the stated past time; it does not assert that the book was finished.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0003-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"结尾\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Ending","options":["Ending","Character","While","Beginning"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Yesterday we started dinner at eight. Xiaoming arrived at half past eight, before we finished. Which sentence describes our meal at his arrival?","correct_answer":"小明到的时候，我们还在吃饭。","options":["小明到的时候，我们已经吃完饭了。","小明到的时候，我们还在吃饭。","明天我们才开始吃饭。","小明到的时候，我们没在吃饭。"],"hint_text":"The meal had begun but was not finished. 还在 means still in progress.","explanation":"小明到的时候，我们还在吃饭。 The meal is in progress at Xiaoming’s arrival. 已经吃完饭了 would mean that we had already finished, contradicting the stated sequence.","distractors":["小明到的时候，我们已经吃完饭了。","明天我们才开始吃饭。","小明到的时候，我们没在吃饭。"],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"ongoing_past_scene"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["先","第一"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["After that"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["同时"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0004-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Character","correct_answer":"人物","metadata":{"tiles":["人物"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “The character in the story was about to open the letter when he suddenly heard someone knocking outside the door.” Start with “故事里的” and end with “敲门。”.","correct_answer":"故事里的人物正要打开那封信，突然听见有人在门外敲门。","metadata":{"tiles":["故事里的","人物","正要","打开","那封信，","突然","听见","有人","在门外","敲门。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["接着"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Lastly","At last","At the end"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["角色"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Plot","correct_answer":"情节","metadata":{"tiles":["情节"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “The plot of the novel takes place in a quiet little village where all the houses stand right beside a wide river.” Start with “小说的” and end with “一条宽阔的河。”.","correct_answer":"小说的情节发生在一个安静的小村庄，村里的房子都紧挨着一条宽阔的河。","metadata":{"tiles":["小说的","情节","发生在","一个","安静的","小村庄，","村里的房子","都","紧挨着","一条宽阔的河。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0005-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","options":["Finally","Next","Then","Ending"]},"after":{"options":["Finally","Before","Then","Ending"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","options":["Ending","Next","Then","Once upon a time"]},"after":{"options":["Ending","Next","Before","Once upon a time"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["终于","最终"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["At the same time"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["剧情","故事情节"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3006-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Beginning","correct_answer":"开头","accepted_answers":[],"metadata":{"tiles":["开头"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “At the beginning of the story, nobody knew why the stranger waited outside the train station every night.” Start with “故事的开头，” and end with “等候。”.","correct_answer":"故事的开头，谁也不知道那个陌生人为什么每天晚上都在火车站前等候。","accepted_answers":["故事的开头，谁也不知道为什么那个陌生人每天晚上都在火车站前等候。","故事的开头，谁也不知道每天晚上那个陌生人为什么都在火车站前等候。"],"metadata":{"tiles":["故事的开头，","谁也","不知道","那个陌生人","为什么","每天晚上","都","在火车站前","等候。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"如果\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"If","options":["Regret","Instead","If","Imagine"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"We have not decided what to do tomorrow. Our plan is: “如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。” What condition is stated for staying at home?","correct_answer":"If it rains tomorrow.","options":["If it rains tomorrow.","If it is sunny tomorrow.","If it rained yesterday.","If we leave home."],"hint_text":"如果 introduces the condition; 明天 locates it tomorrow.","explanation":"The condition is rain tomorrow; staying at home is the planned result. 如果 does not assert that the rain will definitely happen. The sentence does not give a plan for sunny weather.","distractors":["If it is sunny tomorrow.","If it rained yesterday.","If we leave home."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Would","correct_answer":"会","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to Chinese: If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home. Begin with 如果 and use 明天, 我们, 就, 待 and 家里.","correct_answer":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。","accepted_answers":["如果明天下雨我们就待在家里。","如果明天下雨的话，我们就待在家里。","如果明天下雨的话我们就待在家里。","如果明天下雨，我们就会待在家里。","如果明天下雨我们就会待在家里。","如果明天下雨的话，我们就会待在家里。","如果明天下雨的话我们就会待在家里。","如果明天下雨，我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待在家裡。","如果明天下雨我們就會待在家裡。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待在家裡。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待在家裡。","如果明天下雨，我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待在家裏。","如果明天下雨我們就會待在家裏。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待在家裏。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待在家裏。","如果明天下雨，我們就待在家里。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家里。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待在家里。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待在家里。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待在家里。","如果明天下雨我們就會待在家里。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待在家里。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待在家里。","如果明天下雨，我们就待家里。","如果明天下雨我们就待家里。","如果明天下雨的话，我们就待家里。","如果明天下雨的话我们就待家里。","如果明天下雨，我们就会待家里。","如果明天下雨我们就会待家里。","如果明天下雨的话，我们就会待家里。","如果明天下雨的话我们就会待家里。","如果明天下雨，我們就待家裡。","如果明天下雨我們就待家裡。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待家裡。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待家裡。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待家裡。","如果明天下雨我們就會待家裡。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待家裡。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待家裡。","如果明天下雨，我們就待家裏。","如果明天下雨我們就待家裏。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待家裏。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待家裏。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待家裏。","如果明天下雨我們就會待家裏。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待家裏。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待家裏。","如果明天下雨，我們就待家里。","如果明天下雨我們就待家里。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就待家里。","如果明天下雨的話我們就待家里。","如果明天下雨，我們就會待家里。","如果明天下雨我們就會待家里。","如果明天下雨的話，我們就會待家里。","如果明天下雨的話我們就會待家里。"],"hint_text":"Put the condition first, then 我们就待在家里. 会 may be included but is not obligatory.","explanation":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。 如果 introduces the possible condition and 就 links its result. 明天 supplies future reference; the verbs do not inflect for future tense. Ordinary versions with 的话 and/or 会 are accepted, along with traditional script.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","prompt":"Translate to English: 能够","correct_answer":"Could","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Translate to English using will and walk, beginning with If the bus: 如果明天公交车晚点，我们就走路去学校。","correct_answer":"If the bus is late tomorrow, we will walk to school.","accepted_answers":["If the bus is late tomorrow we will walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow, we'll walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow we'll walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow, we will walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow we will walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow, we'll walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow we'll walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow, we will walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow we will walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow, we'll walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow we'll walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow, we will walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow we will walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow, we'll walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow we'll walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow, then we will walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow then we will walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow, then we'll walk to school.","If the bus is late tomorrow then we'll walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow, then we will walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow then we will walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow, then we'll walk to school.","If the bus arrives late tomorrow then we'll walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow, then we will walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow then we will walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow, then we'll walk to school.","If the bus is running late tomorrow then we'll walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow, then we will walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow then we will walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow, then we'll walk to school.","If the bus is delayed tomorrow then we'll walk to school."],"hint_text":"晚点 gives the condition; 走路去学校 gives the planned consequence.","explanation":"If the bus is late tomorrow, we will walk to school. The 明天 context supplies the future reference. 就 introduces the result here without requiring a separate English then.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"应_____ (Should)","correct_answer":"该","hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Choose 就 or 却 to express the then-result, not a contrast: 如果明天下雨，我们___待在家里。","correct_answer":"就","hint_text":"Use the result-linking member of the 如果...就... pattern.","explanation":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。 就 links the condition to its result. 却 would introduce a contrast, which is not the relation requested in this task; it is not declared ungrammatical in all contexts.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Perhaps","correct_answer":"也许","metadata":{"tiles":["也许"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “If it rains tomorrow, perhaps we will stay at home and watch a film together.” Start with “如果” and end with “一部电影。”.","correct_answer":"如果明天下雨，我们也许会留在家里，一起看一部电影。","metadata":{"tiles":["如果","明天","下雨，","我们","也许","会","留在家里，","一起","看","一部电影。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"error_correction","prompt":"Find and correct the error: 想象x","metadata":{"error_sentence":"想象x"},"correct_answer":"想象","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Correct the placement of the conditional-result marker.","metadata":{"error_sentence":"如果明天下雨，我们待在家就里。","correction_instruction":"Move 就 to immediately before 待 to mark the conditional result. Keep every other word and its order unchanged; return the complete corrected sentence."},"correct_answer":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。","accepted_answers":["如果明天下雨，我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨，我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨，我們就待在家里。","如果明天下雨我们就待在家里。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家裡。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家裏。","如果明天下雨我們就待在家里。"],"hint_text":"就 belongs before the predicate 待在家里, not inside 家里.","explanation":"如果明天下雨，我们就待在家里。 Move 就 out of 家里 and place it before 待. The result clause then says that we will stay at home under the stated condition.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0001-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"否则\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Otherwise","options":["Could","I wish","Otherwise","Consequence"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Our plan is: “如果明天公交车晚点，我们就走路去学校。” If the bus is late tomorrow, what does this plan say we will do?","correct_answer":"We will walk to school.","options":["We will take a taxi to school.","We will stay at home.","We will walk to school.","We will cancel school."],"hint_text":"The result is 我们就走路去学校.","explanation":"We will walk to school if the bus is late. The plan gives neither a taxi nor staying home or canceling school. It leaves the on-time-bus case unstated.","distractors":["We will take a taxi to school.","We will stay at home.","We will cancel school."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"possible_future_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000001","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"会\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Would","options":["If","Otherwise","Instead","Would"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"The speaker does not own a car now and imagines a different situation: “如果我有一辆车，我就会开车去海边。” What is the imagined result?","correct_answer":"The speaker would go to the seaside by car.","options":["The speaker would go to the seaside by car.","The speaker already owns a car.","The speaker took a train yesterday.","The speaker would stay at home."],"hint_text":"如果 introduces the imagined possession; 开车去海边 gives the consequence.","explanation":"The imagined result is driving to the seaside. The explicit current fact makes this a hypothetical alternative. 如果...就... can express other kinds of conditions too; it is not a dedicated grammatical past or counterfactual tense.","distractors":["The speaker already owns a car.","The speaker took a train yesterday.","The speaker would stay at home."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","prompt":"Translate to Chinese: Could","correct_answer":"能够","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"I have little free time now. Translate this imagined alternative to Chinese: If I had more time, I would read more. Use the frame 如果我...，我就... with 更多时间 and 多读书; 的 may be included in 更多的时间.","correct_answer":"如果我有更多时间，我就多读书。","accepted_answers":["如果我有更多时间我就多读书。","如果我有更多时间，我就会多读书。","如果我有更多时间我就会多读书。","如果我有更多时间的话，我就多读书。","如果我有更多时间的话我就多读书。","如果我有更多时间的话，我就会多读书。","如果我有更多时间的话我就会多读书。","如果我有更多的时间，我就多读书。","如果我有更多的时间我就多读书。","如果我有更多的时间，我就会多读书。","如果我有更多的时间我就会多读书。","如果我有更多的时间的话，我就多读书。","如果我有更多的时间的话我就多读书。","如果我有更多的时间的话，我就会多读书。","如果我有更多的时间的话我就会多读书。","如果我有更多時間，我就多讀書。","如果我有更多時間我就多讀書。","如果我有更多時間，我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多時間我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多時間的話，我就多讀書。","如果我有更多時間的話我就多讀書。","如果我有更多時間的話，我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多時間的話我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間，我就多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間我就多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間，我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間的話，我就多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間的話我就多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間的話，我就會多讀書。","如果我有更多的時間的話我就會多讀書。"],"hint_text":"Use 有更多时间 for having more time and 多读书 for reading more. 会 and 的话 may be included.","explanation":"如果我有更多时间，我就多读书。 The stated lack of time gives the hypothetical-present interpretation; the verb 有 does not inflect into an English past form. 会 and 的话 are optional in the accepted versions. Traditional-script forms are also accepted.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000003","before":{"les