ealthy, I'd work less.","If I was very wealthy, then I'd work less.","I'd work less, if I was very wealthy.","If I was very wealthy I'd work less.","If I was very wealthy then I'd work less.","I'd work less if I was very wealthy."],"hint_text":"很有钱 means rich here; 少工作 means work less.","explanation":"If I were rich, I would work less. The speaker’s stated current situation selects an imagined alternative. Chinese does not use a past-tense inflection to express it. English were and ordinary informal was are both accepted.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","prompt":"我_____ (I wish)","correct_answer":"希望","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"A person imagines being a bird. Choose 会 or 过 for the imagined result, “I would fly to the seaside”: 如果我是一只鸟，我就___飞到海边。","correct_answer":"会","accepted_answers":["會"],"hint_text":"Use the modal before 飞, not the experience marker 过 in this position.","explanation":"如果我是一只鸟，我就会飞到海边。 会 introduces the imagined result in this context. It is not itself a past-tense ending or a universally counterfactual marker; the imaginary bird situation supplies that interpretation.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["或许","可能"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Imagine","correct_answer":"想象","metadata":{"tiles":["想象"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Imagine: if you lived by the sea, you could listen to the waves while taking a walk every morning.” Start with “想象一下，” and end with “海浪的声音。”.","correct_answer":"想象一下，如果你住在海边，每天早晨就能一边散步，一边听海浪的声音。","metadata":{"tiles":["想象一下，","如果","你","住在","海边，","每天早晨","就能","一边","散步，","一边","听","海浪的声音。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000007","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"error_correction","prompt":"Find and correct the error: 假设x","metadata":{"error_sentence":"假设x"},"correct_answer":"假设","accepted_answers":[],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Correct the placement of 就 in the imagined result.","metadata":{"error_sentence":"如果我有更多时间，我多就读书。","correction_instruction":"The speaker imagines having more time now. Move 就 to immediately before 多 in the result clause. Keep every other word and its order unchanged; return the complete corrected sentence."},"correct_answer":"如果我有更多时间，我就多读书。","accepted_answers":["如果我有更多时间我就多读书。","如果我有更多時間，我就多讀書。","如果我有更多時間我就多讀書。"],"hint_text":"就 comes before 多读书 in this conditional-result pattern.","explanation":"如果我有更多时间，我就多读书。 Move 就 before 多. Do not add 会 or omit a subject in this keep-every-word correction, even though such changes may be possible in a separate translation task.","skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-e00000000010","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0002-b10000000000","type":"multiple_choice","prompt":"What does \"后悔\" mean in English?","correct_answer":"Regret","options":["Regret","Consequence","Should","Otherwise"],"hint_text":null,"explanation":null,"distractors":[],"skill_type":"vocabulary","target_grammar":null},"after":{"prompt":"Xiaohong has very little time today and says: “如果我现在有更多时间，我就会去看你。” What kind of situation is she describing?","correct_answer":"An imagined situation with more time now.","options":["An imagined situation with more time now.","A completed trip last year.","A confirmed appointment tomorrow.","A statement that the speaker already has plenty of time."],"hint_text":"现在 means now. Read the conditional together with the stated current lack of time.","explanation":"Xiaohong imagines having more time now and visiting under that condition. The context, not a past-tense verb ending, distinguishes the imagined alternative from her actual situation. No completed past visit or confirmed future appointment is stated.","distractors":["A completed trip last year.","A confirmed appointment tomorrow.","A statement that the speaker already has plenty of time."],"skill_type":"grammar","target_grammar":"hypothetical_present_condition"}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["应当","应"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["I hope"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["想像","设想"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0003-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Suppose","correct_answer":"假设","metadata":{"tiles":["假设"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “Suppose you lose your passport abroad; it is best to first contact the local police and your country’s embassy.” Start with “假设” and end with “本国的大使馆。”.","correct_answer":"假设你在国外丢了护照，最好先联系当地的警察和本国的大使馆。","metadata":{"tiles":["假设","你","在国外","丢了","护照，","最好","先","联系","当地的警察","和","本国的大使馆。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Maybe","Possibly"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["像"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["假定"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0004-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Instead","correct_answer":"代替","metadata":{"tiles":["代替"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “If someone could cover my shift tomorrow, I could go to the seaside with my friends.” Start with “要是” and end with “去海边了。”.","correct_answer":"要是明天有人能代替我值班，我就可以和朋友一起去海边了。","metadata":{"tiles":["要是","明天","有人","能","代替","我","值班，","我","就可以","和朋友","一起","去海边了。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["或许","可能"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["To imagine","Imagination"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["定"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0005-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Otherwise","correct_answer":"否则","metadata":{"tiles":["否则"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “I regret not following your advice at the time; otherwise I would not have missed that important interview.” Start with “我后悔” and end with “重要的面试。”.","correct_answer":"我后悔当时没有听你的建议，否则就不会错过那次重要的面试。","metadata":{"tiles":["我后悔","当时","没有","听你的建议，","否则","就不会","错过","那次","重要的面试。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["想像","设想"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Supposition","Assumption","To suppose"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["不然","要不然"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3007-0006-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Regret","correct_answer":"后悔","metadata":{"tiles":["后悔"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “I really regret turning down that job; if I had accepted the opportunity then, I might be happier now.” Start with “我” and end with “更开心。”.","correct_answer":"我很后悔拒绝了那份工作，要是当时接受了那个机会，现在也许会更开心。","metadata":{"tiles":["我","很后悔","拒绝了","那份工作，","要是","当时","接受了","那个机会，","现在","也许","会","更开心。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Yours sincerely","Yours faithfully"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-e00000000005","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-b10000000000","type":"cloze_deletion","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["有点儿","有些","有一点"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0001-b10000000000","type":"sentence_construction","prompt":"Arrange the words to translate: Cool","correct_answer":"酷","metadata":{"tiles":["酷"],"distractors":[]}},"after":{"prompt":"Arrange every word or phrase tile to translate: “In a formal request, rather than saying “This idea is cool,” it is better to write “I respectfully ask you to consider this proposal.”” Start with “在正式的请求中，” and end with “这个方案”。”.","correct_answer":"在正式的请求中，与其说“这个主意很酷”，不如写“恳请您考虑这个方案”。","metadata":{"tiles":["在正式的请求中，","与其","说","“这个主意很酷”，","不如","写","“恳请您","考虑","这个方案”。"],"distractors":[],"tile_joiner":""}}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-e00000000002","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_target","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["谨上","敬上"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-e00000000003","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"translate_to_native","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["Greetings"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-e00000000004","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-b10000000000","type":"fill_blank","accepted_answers":[]},"after":{"accepted_answers":["些","一点"]}},{"table":"exercises","id":"aabbccdd-8888-3008-0002-e00000000006","before":{"lesson_id":"aabbccdd